@aboveavgbowler @Mike_Ess_ Appreciate the feedback here. I'm curious if you watch Fomo Hour? I cover the Stonk eco pretty much every day on that show and I think I cover it pretty objectively. But if there's anything specific you can point to, let me know...

The aspect that's new here from Pump is opening it up to any coin on their protocol. I believe Stonk still does curated rollouts for 5-10 tokens per day. Correct me if I'm wrong.

As for calling it an "experiment," I chose that word because I think it's pretty unclear still if there is sustained demand for custom pairs like this or if it's just a near-term meta. I do think it's fun and I've been deep trading the custom pairs, across Stonk and Pump.

