Here's a look at the Mag 7 acquisitions. Also some of these 846 cos are MONSTERS eg if Google spun out YouTube it would be a Top 20 S&amp;P 500 stock. These are small countries, each could be its own index tbh. You have to see through the one name. https://t.co/vNwgTyueNt

